very bucket list. Here are the top things to know before you go.","featuredImage":{"__typename":"Image","height":3669,"url":"https://lp-cms-production.imgix.net/2022-01/GettyImages-1291588762.jpg","width":5500},"readTime":9,"slug":"things-to-know-before-traveling-to-colorado","tags":["national-parks","activities","budget-travel","connections","tips-and-advice","destination-practicalities"],"title":"Things you need to know to have a great time in Colorado","dateISO":"2022-07-21T15:10:01Z","href":"/articles/things-to-know-before-traveling-to-colorado","subhead":"Jul 21, 2022 • 9 min read"},{"__typename":"Article","date":"Jul 21, 2022","esid":"f578a87d-5a2d-42ab-8ba3-b6e566a6bd0d","excerpt":"Whether you want all-inclusive luxury or the wild outdoors in all its raw beauty, Colorado has a hot spring for you.","featuredImage":{"__typename":"Image","height":1414,"url":"https://lp-cms-production.imgix.net/2022-03/Colorado%20Jordan%20Siemens%20GettyImages-523413442%20RFC.jpg","width":2121},"readTime":6,"slug":"best-hot-springs-in-colorado","tags":["water-sports","activities","wildlife-and-nature"],"title":"The 7 best hot springs in Colorado, from high-end luxury to the wild outdoors","dateISO":"2022-07-21T14:10:01Z","href":"/articles/best-hot-springs-in-colorado","subhead":"Jul 21, 2022 • 6 min read"},{"__typename":"Article","date":"May 10, 2022","esid":"1d772836-9f70-4cad-8fa1-90c2406d59d5","excerpt":"Colorado teems with drives whose views and attractions astound. Here are seven of the best road trips in the Western state.","featuredImage":{"__typename":"Image","height":2848,"url":"https://lp-cms-production.imgix.net/2021-03/shutterstockRF_21572626.jpg","width":3432},"readTime":6,"slug":"best-road-trips-in-colorado","tags":["sports","activities","road-trips","destination-practicalities","tips-and-advice"],"title":"Rockies roads: the most thrilling drives in Colorado","dateISO":"2022-05-10T14:00:00Z","href":"/articles/best-road-trips-in-colorado","subhead":"May 10, 2022 • 6 